  "title": "Mermaid",
  "summary": "Mermaid 是一個用文字就可以畫流程圖的工具。只要用簡單的語法，不用滑鼠拖拉，它就自動幫你畫出來排版好！根本就是圖表界的 Markdown。",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"http://mermaid.js.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Mermaid</a> 是一個用文字就可以畫流程圖的工具。只要用簡單的語法，不用滑鼠拖拉，它就自動幫你畫出來排版好！根本就是圖表界的 <a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/why-use-markdown\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Markdown</a>。</p>\n<p>例如，我只要打這樣短短幾行：</p>\n<div><div><pre><code><div><span>flowchart </span><span>TB</span><span></span><br></div><div><span>    </span><span>A</span><span>{</span><span>你想吃蛋餅嗎？</span><span>}</span><span></span><br></div><div><span>    </span><span>B</span><span>[</span><span>還不趕快吃！</span><span>]</span><span></span><br></div><div><span>    </span><span>C</span><span>[</span><span>確定嗎？</span><span>]</span><span></span><br></div><div><span>    </span><span>D</span><span>[</span><span>再考慮一次</span><span>]</span><span></span><br></div><div><span>    </span><br></div><div><span>    </span><span>A</span><span> </span><span>--</span><span>&gt;</span><span>|</span><span>想</span><span>|</span><span> </span><span>B</span><span></span><br></div><div><span>    </span><span>A</span><span> </span><span>--</span><span>&gt;</span><span>|</span><span>不想</span><span>|</span><span> </span><span>C</span><span></span><br></div><div><span>    </span><span>C</span><span> </span><span>--</span><span>&gt;</span><span> </span><span>D</span><span></span><br></div><div><span>    </span><span>D</span><span> </span><span>--</span><span>&gt;</span><span> </span><span>A</span><br></div></code></pre></div></div>\n<p>它就可以直接變成下面的圖：</p>\n\n<p>而且支援各種形式的圖表，像是：</p>\n\n<p>還有：</p>",
